{
  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af3f1cb3-b98e-4b68-b2cb-5442314b8d4e\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\" width=\"100%\"/>\n\n# HyperOS Launcher Mod\n\n**The HyperOS launcher with more features, smoother animations and many more options.**\n\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/releases/latest)\n[![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/releases)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/stargazers)\n[![Telegram](https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-channel-26A5E4?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white)](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs)\n\n</div>\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **V7.5 is the final release** of this mod. For HyperOS 4, see the [HyperOS 4 Rust Launcher Mod](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Rust-Launcher-Mod).\n\n## Features\n- Widget stacking\n- Super icon support for any app\n- iOS-inspired app-open animation\n- Icon shapes\n- Dock that resizes itself to fit the number of icons, with a dock background\n- Custom app names on the home screen and in the app drawer\n- Open search and the keyboard directly in the app drawer\n- OriginOS-style recents transition, stacked recents and the \"go back to previous app\" gesture\n- Better blur effects (glassy blur on HyperOS 3)\n\n## Requirements\n- HyperOS 2 or HyperOS 3\n- Magisk, KernelSU or APatch\n\n## Installation\n1. Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/releases/latest).\n2. Flash it in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch.\n3. Reboot your device.\n\n## Notes\n- Signature verification must be disabled. Flash [Apk Protection Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Protection-Patch) or [Apk Signature Verification Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Signature-Verification-Patch) first, or use the Core Patch LSPosed module.\n\n### FAQ\nRead the [FAQ](FAQV6.md) before reporting an issue. It covers blur, folder backgrounds, Circle to Search and common crashes.\n\n## Screenshots\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85d42455-1dc2-4d1e-a8c3-aa1ed3e64226\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cd29603-b5dc-4e0f-b673-ed5dfb7a7bb5\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7db4444-7b48-4750-be6e-932ea4c9940e\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20c6deab-e4aa-4f4c-940a-10756ae4678a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67b70d89-ef8c-43d3-84d8-3f267ace4cf8\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe66267c-e5bb-43f9-b6ea-3d372350fd49\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af926107-15d1-455f-baee-b01131d5509b\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdca90ee-79db-4d87-a561-f1a3fec40f57\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ca501b6-94b8-4196-bd16-ba319ca92417\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/777973ce-1fbe-4946-a09c-3f25e58f756a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/825e7320-58ce-494d-8c86-92153387da5c\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f054fc75-eeb6-4f19-aea8-796cf0d595f5\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b110549-d4fc-4943-8ba4-01af6764d681\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3def61eb-c792-488a-ac10-594cdcac3b42\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3fdd2c3e-38d2-4d6d-bdd2-b516244d4132\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc9f6a0b-3cfa-4cb9-a940-32440f3d2a12\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bca61f14-342d-4d66-98f8-586035c23468\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2c5143b-233e-4bbf-8665-ab5cef051747\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\nMade by **[🅺🅰🆂🅷🅸](https://t.me/kakashi1v1)** · part of **[Mods Center](https://github.com/Mods-Center)**\n\n[Website](https://modscenter.org) · [Channel](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs) · [Support group](https://t.me/bootloop_discussion) · [Report a bug](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/issues)\n\n</div>\n",
  "readmeHTML": "<p><div align=\"center\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af3f1cb3-b98e-4b68-b2cb-5442314b8d4e\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\" width=\"100%\"/></p>\n\n<h1>HyperOS Launcher Mod</h1>\n\n<p><b>The HyperOS launcher with more features, smoother animations and many more options.</b></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff\">![Release</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/releases/latest)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158\">![Downloads</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/releases)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a\">![Stars</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/stargazers)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-channel-26A5E4?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white\">![Telegram</a>](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs)</p>\n\n<p></div></p>\n\n<p>> [!NOTE]</p>\n<p>> <b>V7.5 is the final release</b> of this mod. For HyperOS 4, see the <a href=\"https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Rust-Launcher-Mod\">HyperOS 4 Rust Launcher Mod</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<li>Widget stacking</li>\n<li>Super icon support for any app</li>\n<li>iOS-inspired app-open animation</li>\n<li>Icon shapes</li>\n<li>Dock that resizes itself to fit the number of icons, with a dock background</li>\n<li>Custom app names on the home screen and in the app drawer</li>\n<li>Open search and the keyboard directly in the app drawer</li>\n<li>OriginOS-style recents transition, stacked recents and the \"go back to previous app\" gesture</li>\n<li>Better blur effects (glassy blur on HyperOS 3)</li>\n\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<li>HyperOS 2 or HyperOS 3</li>\n<li>Magisk, KernelSU or APatch</li>\n\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<li>Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Launcher/releases/latest).</li>\n<li>Flash it in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch.</li>\n<li>Reboot your device.</li>\n\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<li>Signature verification must be disabled. Flash [Apk Protection Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Protection-Patch) or [Apk Signature Verification Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Signature-Verification-Patch) first, or use the Core Patch LSPosed module.</li>\n\n<h3>FAQ</h3>\n<p>Read the <a href=\"FAQV6.md\">FAQ</a> before reporting an issue. It covers blur, folder backgrounds, Circle to Search and common crashes.</p>\n\n<h2>Screenshots</h2>\n<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85d42455-1dc2-4d1e-a8c3-aa1ed3e64226\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cd29603-b5dc-4e0f-b673-ed5dfb7a7bb5\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7db4444-7b48-4750-be6e-932ea4c9940e\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20c6deab-e4aa-4f4c-940a-10756ae4678a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <br/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67b70d89-ef8c-43d3-84d8-3f267ace4cf8\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe66267c-e5bb-43f9-b6ea-3d372350fd49\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af926107-15d1-455f-baee-b01131d5509b\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdca90ee-79db-4d87-a561-f1a3fec40f57\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"HyperOS Launcher Mod\"/></p>\n<p>  <br/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ca501b6-94b8-4196-bd